1
00:01:33,190 --> 00:01:38,150
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:40,880
[Episode 6]

3
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:45,539
Hello?
What's going on with Zhou Xiangxiang?

4
00:01:45,539 --> 00:01:47,600
There are still two laps left. She...

5
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,520
Speak!

6
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,520
She's burning a lot of energy.

7
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:51,360
She's panting heavily
and looks like she can barely run.

8
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:53,420
She has already fallen to 10th place.

9
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:56,920
Come on, Xiangxiang!

10
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,120
Xiangxiang!

11
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:01,800
-Come on, Xiangxiang! Hang in there!
-Are you okay?

12
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:02,760
Come on!

13
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,120
Come on, Xiangxiang!

14
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:25,800
One last lap for the women's 3,000 meters.

15
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:58,950
♪ Whose heart is beating so fast? ♪

16
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:02,880
♪ I'm trying to probe into her feelings ♪

17
00:03:03,380 --> 00:03:06,790
♪ When our eyes meet, I know deep inside ♪

18
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,920
Exhale, inhale, exhale, inhale.

19
00:03:07,540 --> 00:03:12,960
♪ Just like sparrow bickering ♪

20
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,680
Very good.

21
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,440
Run!

22
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,240
Run!

23
00:03:12,990 --> 00:03:16,590
♪ It's caused by the emotions ♪

24
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:20,730
♪ But our tacit understanding
is doubled secretly ♪

25
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:23,220
♪ What happened? ♪

26
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:30,590
♪ It seemed like destiny,
but it only backfired ♪

27
00:03:31,150 --> 00:03:34,440
♪ The more we separate,
the closer we'll get ♪

28
00:03:34,460 --> 00:03:37,520
♪ And the more fiercely
my heart will beat ♪

29
00:03:38,020 --> 00:03:42,190
♪ Love is the starry sky
that's waiting for someone ♪

30
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:45,650
♪ Let's encounter the gentle breeze ♪

31
00:03:45,670 --> 00:03:49,480
♪ Let's hug when we meet again ♪

32
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,700
♪ Just like the way we did in the past ♪

33
00:03:51,730 --> 00:03:54,590
♪ That was once my dream in my youth ♪

34
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:58,180
♪ Time ebbs and flows, just like a dream ♪

35
00:03:58,210 --> 00:04:00,840
♪ By fate, it's as if ♪

36
00:04:01,590 --> 00:04:04,470
♪ I had been moved by you in every way ♪

37
00:04:05,420 --> 00:04:10,040
♪ You're the starry sky
that remains unchanged ♪

38
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:12,340
♪ And I'm the gentle breeze ♪

39
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:16,829
♪ Our hearts are pounding
when we meet again ♪

40
00:04:16,850 --> 00:04:20,519
♪ We can empathize with each other ♪

41
00:04:20,550 --> 00:04:25,030
♪ In the morning, at dusk
and in the afternoon, we can hold hands ♪

42
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:28,490
♪ I'll kiss your forehead ♪

43
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,870
♪ The reason
for my most certain happiness ♪

44
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:34,470
♪ Is the gentleness of first love ♪

45
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:33,680
Kiss!

46
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,000
Kiss!

47
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:46,680
-That's so sweet!
-Kiss!

48
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,000
Awesome!

49
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:01,280
Super awesome!

50
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:09,240
Third place in the College of Liberal Arts
of Jiangcheng University.

51
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,640
That also counts as defeating Duan Xiaoyu.

52
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,880
Let's take a group photo together

53
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:13,720
to commemorate this.

54
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,360
Okay.

55
00:05:15,420 --> 00:05:16,220
[Third Place of the College of Liberal Arts
of Jiangcheng University]

56
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:17,690
[Third Place of the College of Liberal Arts
of Jiangcheng University]

57
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,080
I'm going to post it on Moments

58
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,280
and tag Duan Xiaoyu.

59
00:05:47,310 --> 00:05:48,140
[Hugging a guy
who is usually quite aloof,]

60
00:05:48,159 --> 00:05:48,990
[why was I blushing
and why was my heart racing?]

61
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,320
Of course it was because of love.

62
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:52,990
[21 answers]

63
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:53,900
Or maybe it was
just because he was handsome.

64
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:56,080
Have you heard of
the Suspension Bridge Effect?

65
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,960
It depends on when the hug happened.

66
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,640
It can't be love.

67
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:01,640
This is definitely true love, okay?

68
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,520
No way.

69
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:06,400
Have I really fallen in love
with that big iceberg?

70
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:28,400
How come it's you?

71
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,280
Who did you expect?

72
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,680
No, no, I mean...

73
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:34,960
Why are you the only one here?

74
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:36,159
Where are the others?

75
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,920
One went to the Classical Literature Club,

76
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,680
and the other went to
an Internet influencer gathering.

77
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,000
So you have nothing to do?

78
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,040
I have things to do, too.

79
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:44,500
I'm not talking to you anymore.
I'm leaving.

80
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,680
How could this happen?

81
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:14,480
This one.

82
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:17,640
Thanks.

83
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,880
Do you want to eat with me?

84
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,240
I've...

85
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,040
eaten.

86
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,060
I'll get going now.

87
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:04,520
Hello.

88
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:05,240
A bowl of mutton soup, please.

89
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:05,880
Okay.

90
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,440
Zhou Xiangxiang?

91
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:33,730
Zhou Xiangxiang from Class 2,
Kunzhou No. 1 Primary School.

92
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,480
How did you know that?

93
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:38,360
You don't even recognize me?

94
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,440
Fatty.

95
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:46,760
You can recognize me now, huh?

96
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:47,880
Why are you here?

97
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,000
I'm here to eat,

98
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,690
and I ran into you, didn't I?

99
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:52,840
Are you studying nearby

100
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,200
at Jiangcheng University?

101
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,480
Yes. What about you?

102
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,640
I'm here on a business trip.

103
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:00,240
Business trip? So you're already working?

104
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,200
With my grades,

105
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,600
I definitely couldn't get into college.

106
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,680
So after graduating from high school,

107
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:04,740
I started working.

108
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,960
You're already making money now.

109
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:08,020
I'm envious of you.

110
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:09,640
I think you'll become

111
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:11,280
a famous TV host soon, right?

112
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:12,640
If I want to see you in the future,

113
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:14,240
will I have to watch you on TV?

114
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,250
I'm not majoring in broadcasting.

115
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,480
Haven't you had the potential

116
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,210
to be a host since you were a kid?

117
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,600
You used to talk every day

118
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,400
about hoping to become Lin Hong.

119
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,360
It was all thanks to someone

120
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,480
who splashed paint all over me.

121
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,600
I saw you smirking

122
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:31,760
up there.

123
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,080
Are you talking about

124
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:35,960
that New Year Gala in primary school?

125
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:39,640
D-Do you really think
I was the one who embarrassed you?

126
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:40,770
Who else could it be?

127
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,490
I'm innocent. It really wasn't me.

128
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:45,720
I've been taking the blame

129
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,680
for someone else all these years.

130
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,080
What do you mean?

131
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,200
Gu Xiaoli caused all the trouble.

132
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:56,080
Gu Xiaoli?

133
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,400
Xiaoli?

134
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,400
He was the little boy

135
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:04,320
who used to live next door to us.

136
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,930
He was good at studying,

137
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,610
but he was kind of taciturn.

138
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,480
His parents were busy with business

139
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:11,210
and always left him home alone.

140
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,280
You even brought him to our home

141
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,800
for dinner every day.

142
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,600
Really?

143
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,720
Don't you remember?

144
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:19,520
Back then,

145
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,840
you always called him

146
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,880
Xiaoli

147
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:23,840
and followed him around.

148
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:29,000
The name seems to be somewhat familiar,

149
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:31,040
but I can't remember anything else.

150
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,440
No wonder.

151
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,880
When their family moved away,

152
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:34,880
you were only six.

153
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:38,760
Why did you suddenly
think of asking about him?

154
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:40,520
I just happened to run into Fatty

155
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:42,360
from the compound we used to live in,

156
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,420
so we chatted a bit.

157
00:10:45,010 --> 00:10:46,600
Mom, I have a call coming in.

158
00:10:47,280 --> 00:10:47,920
Okay.

159
00:10:47,590 --> 00:10:48,940
[Fatty]

160
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,640
Hello.

161
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,240
Hello, is that Xiaoli?

162
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,640
Gu Han?

163
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,080
That's a nice name.

164
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:28,480
Why did you change it into this name?

165
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:30,920
My mom thought my old name was too tacky,

166
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:31,800
so she changed it.

167
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:33,860
I'm still used to calling you Xiaoli.

168
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,840
Both are okay. It's up to you.

169
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:37,240
It's been so many years,

170
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,360
and you've changed so much.

171
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,080
You've grown so tall

172
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:41,210
that I almost couldn't recognize you.

173
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,460
You've changed a lot, too.

174
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:45,840
Are you studying in college in Jiangcheng?

175
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:46,440
Yes.

176
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:48,320
Jiangcheng University?

177
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:51,800
Then you and Zhou Xiangxiang
are schoolmates.

178
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,370
Don't you remember?

179
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:55,920
When we were kids,

180
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,680
she was the little girl
who lived across from you.

181
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,040
When you went back to Kunzhou later,

182
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,760
didn't you specifically look for her once?

183
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:02,820
But she had moved out of the compound.

184
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:08,420
You haven't seen each other at school yet,
have you?

185
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,540
So you've seen her?

186
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:11,740
I was eating near here yesterday,

187
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:12,880
and coincidentally,

188
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:13,720
I ran into her.

189
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,920
As a grown-up,
she has really changed a lot.

190
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:16,920
We talked a lot,

191
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,460
and even talked about you.

192
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:20,440
What did you say about me?

193
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,160
I've been taking the blame for you

194
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:22,320
in front of Zhou Xiangxiang

195
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,680
for so many years.

196
00:12:24,400 --> 00:12:25,360
Our school's New Year Gala

197
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,880
was held on the day you left.

198
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:28,080
Do you remember that?

199
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:34,840
Respected teachers and dear schoolmates,

200
00:12:33,150 --> 00:12:35,420
[New Year Gala]

201
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,640
happy New Year to you all.

202
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:40,680
Xiaoli, I'm nervous.

203
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:41,680
It's okay.

204
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:42,720
When you host the gala later,

205
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,240
I'll be right there watching you.

206
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:44,840
Gu Xiaoli.

207
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,480
Okay.

208
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,320
Ma'am.

209
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,360
Come out for a moment.

210
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:49,920
Respected teachers and dear schoolmates,

211
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,680
happy New Year to you all.

212
00:12:52,510 --> 00:12:53,680
[New Year Gala]

213
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,080
Fatty.

214
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:57,880
What's the matter?

215
00:12:57,880 --> 00:12:58,920
The teacher is calling me.

216
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:00,320
Keep an eye on this for me.

217
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,880
Later, the first performance
is Umbrella Dance.

218
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:04,040
Halfway through the show,

219
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:05,960
pull this control line

220
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,440
to sprinkle the colored powder.

221
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,320
Got it.

222
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:15,160
Can't we wait till the evening gala
is over and then leave?

223
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:26,920
On this beautiful winter day,
basking in the warm sunshine,

224
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:29,520
we're gathering here
with joy in our hearts...

225
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:42,640
It's okay.

226
00:13:42,640 --> 00:13:43,720
When you host the gala later,

227
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,580
I'll be right there watching you.

228
00:13:58,200 --> 00:14:00,200
Don't you think this was your fault?

229
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:02,120
You have to pay for this meal.

230
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,600
Seriously?

231
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:10,320
Weren't these just some
embarrassing childhood incidents?

232
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:12,560
I don't think Zhou Xiangxiang minds it

233
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,820
or takes it seriously.

234
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,660
Have you told her everything?

235
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,440
Zhou Xiangxiang also thinks

236
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:21,170
it was just an embarrassing
childhood incident.

237
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:22,320
Don't worry.

238
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:24,660
I didn't tell her I would contact you.

239
00:14:26,280 --> 00:14:28,760
I really want to be like Senior Lin Hong.

240
00:14:31,520 --> 00:14:32,680
I want to be a host who can truly

241
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:34,520
face the audience.

242
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:39,520
-Come down!
-Come down!

243
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:38,550
[Recruitment of TV Station Broadcasters,
Second-Round Auditions]

244
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:44,160
I'm leaving in a couple of days.

245
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:45,960
How about we get together again?

246
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:46,960
I know.

247
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:49,120
You didn't like crowds
when you were a kid.

248
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,850
There will be just the two of us.

249
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,320
Thank you, Ma'am.

250
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:06,160
You're welcome.

251
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,760
Mom, why are you here?

252
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:10,360
We have to hurry to Jiangcheng today.

253
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:13,280
Didn't you say we would go next week?

254
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:16,240
Your dad's and my business partners
arrived in Jiangcheng ahead of time.

255
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:18,440
So we have to hurry to Jiangcheng today.

256
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,560
Don't worry.

257
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:22,320
I've already finished
your school transfer procedure.

258
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:23,880
Come on. Let's go catch the train.

259
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:25,080
What about my dad?

260
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:27,160
Your dad went back to get the luggage.

261
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:29,840
Let's go to the train station now
and wait for him there, okay?

262
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:30,480
Let's go.

263
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,240
Can't we wait till the evening gala
is over and then leave?

264
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:35,240
Be good.

265
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:37,040
We have to go catch the train now.

266
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:41,240
Let's go. What's wrong with you?

267
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:42,600
Be good.

268
00:16:06,570 --> 00:16:08,290
[Contacts]

269
00:16:08,290 --> 00:16:09,110
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

270
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:14,640
Come on! Cheers! Cheers!

271
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,800
-Cheers!
-Come on!

272
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,440
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

273
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,440
Gu Xiaoli is here.

274
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:22,010
-Xiaoli.
-Come on.

275
00:16:22,010 --> 00:16:22,640
Xiaoli.

276
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:23,680
-Come on, Xiaoli.
-You're here.

277
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:24,760
-You're here.
-Do you guys still remember him?

278
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:25,160
Have a seat.

279
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:26,290
Yes, I remember him.

280
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:27,560
Back then,

281
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:29,960
my dad always asked me
to study with Xiaoli.

282
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:33,480
Glasses from the 2nd floor,
the Prince of Love Songs in the compound.

283
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:34,610
Do you remember him?

284
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,080
Let's have a drink. Come on.

285
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:37,120
Come on.

286
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,000
Bottoms up, guys.

287
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:42,240
By the way,
Zhou Xiangxiang is also in Jiangcheng.

288
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:43,080
Will she come?

289
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:44,600
Which Zhou Xiangxiang?

290
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,760
At the New Year Gala,

291
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:47,320
she was the one
who got turned into a rainbow chicken.

292
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:48,520
You've forgotten her, huh?

293
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:50,480
Let me tell you.
If that incident had happened to me,

294
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:51,320
and I knew who did it,

295
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,980
I would never forgive him
for the rest of my life.

296
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:55,570
What do you mean?

297
00:16:56,400 --> 00:16:57,600
Don't be angry.

298
00:16:57,880 --> 00:17:00,160
Actually, today, this is just a gathering
of childhood friends.

299
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:01,560
We're all close friends.

300
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:02,320
That day, I noticed that

301
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:03,800
after hearing me talk about our childhood,

302
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:05,240
you seemed quite sorry

303
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:06,440
for Zhou Xiangxiang,

304
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:07,920
so I wanted to host a gathering

305
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:10,119
for you guys to meet and have a good chat.

306
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:12,480
I was afraid you'd be
too embarrassed to come,

307
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,920
so I didn't tell you in advance.

308
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,720
Zhou Xiangxiang is coming, too?

309
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,050
She should be here soon.

310
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:19,079
Hello. Do you

311
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:20,480
need to order now?

312
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:21,300
Yes, yes, yes.

313
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,680
What do you guys want to eat?

314
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,480
Order whatever you want.

315
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,240
It's all on me today. My treat.

316
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:45,840
105.

317
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:51,000
105.

318
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:09,120
Welcome, Xiangxiang.

319
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:10,160
Let's drink a toast to her.

320
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:10,960
Come on.

321
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:13,690
-Cheers!
-It's been a long time since we last met.

322
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:19,880
Honestly speaking...

323
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:20,760
Hello, Xiaoli.

324
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:21,760
Where are you?

325
00:18:21,760 --> 00:18:22,960
Keep your voice down.

326
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:25,060
Where is Zhou Xiangxiang?

327
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:27,880
She's chatting with everyone happily.

328
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:29,120
I'm leaving first today.

329
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:30,320
Let's meet again another day.

330
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:31,320
You mustn't tell her

331
00:18:31,320 --> 00:18:32,320
that I am Gu Xiaoli.

332
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:33,080
Understand?

333
00:18:33,320 --> 00:18:34,240
-Got it.
-Let's take a look.

334
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:36,500
I'll definitely keep it a secret for you.

335
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:38,800
What's wrong?

336
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:41,160
Xiaoli said he had something to do,
so he left first.

337
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:42,040
He'll see us next time.

338
00:18:42,040 --> 00:18:43,080
-Let's have a drink.
-Okay.

339
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,560
-Come on. Let's have a drink.
-Let's drink.

340
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:45,160
Cheers.

341
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:50,920
Everyone,

342
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:53,480
our course is about to end.

343
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:55,280
Thank you all

344
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:57,200
for putting up with me this semester.

345
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,530
Alright. Thank you all.

346
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:03,400
We still have one last

347
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,440
practical research.

348
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:05,480
I hope that you all

349
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:07,120
can write your papers well.

350
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,450
Alright. Class is over.

351
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:12,000
As for the borrowing situation
of the university library,

352
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,080
how should we divide the work this time?

353
00:19:14,080 --> 00:19:15,640
How about we do it like before?

354
00:19:15,640 --> 00:19:16,640
The two of us will do the questionnaires.

355
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,880
Gu Han, you can take Xiangxiang

356
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,540
to go straight to the library.

357
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:22,400
We'll get going then.

358
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,520
-Bye bye.
-Bye bye.

359
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:27,400
Let's go.

360
00:19:27,430 --> 00:19:28,790
[The Dressmaker]

361
00:20:04,830 --> 00:20:10,190
[Market Research Complete Manual]
[Chinese Travel Prose Series]

362
00:20:10,210 --> 00:20:11,870
How should we divide the work?

363
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:15,960
It's okay. I'll do it.

364
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:27,500
How about this?

365
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:29,500
You are familiar with literature,

366
00:20:29,500 --> 00:20:31,600
art and history.

367
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:33,000
Here.

368
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:34,880
I'll leave these to you,

369
00:20:34,880 --> 00:20:36,540
and then I'll handle the rest.

370
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:40,000
There's so much work.

371
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:42,140
Can you finish it all by yourself?

372
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:47,930
I'm almost done sorting them out.

373
00:21:47,930 --> 00:21:50,660
If you're tired,
go back first and get some sleep.

374
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:58,520
He's so gentle today.

375
00:21:59,040 --> 00:22:02,160
Could it be that
he also has feelings for...

376
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:04,600
What's wrong with you today?

377
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:07,920
Every time we do research,

378
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:10,050
you always find ways to boss me around.

379
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,280
You're so mild today.

380
00:22:14,600 --> 00:22:16,000
If a person is always so fierce,

381
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:17,600
isn't that really annoying?

382
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:23,120
Actually,

383
00:22:23,600 --> 00:22:26,200
being fierce is just a facade sometimes.

384
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:29,040
Captain Gu, if it weren't
for your strict requirements,

385
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:31,500
I wouldn't have
made it into that 80 percent.

386
00:22:38,800 --> 00:22:40,680
I can't go. I have to train.

387
00:22:41,100 --> 00:22:41,620
Skip it?

388
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:43,120
Don't joke around.

389
00:22:43,120 --> 00:22:44,640
Captain Gu will kill me.

390
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:46,000
I'll definitely be there next time.

391
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:46,840
Watch out!

392
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:52,680
Li Sirui?

393
00:22:56,320 --> 00:22:58,240
♪ I want to ♪

394
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:00,060
This guy must be crazy.

395
00:23:00,780 --> 00:23:04,680
♪ Climb up step by step ♪

396
00:23:05,400 --> 00:23:07,800
♪ At the highest point ♪

397
00:23:08,840 --> 00:23:10,600
Li Sirui, get out of the way!

398
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:12,960
♪ Fly forward ♪

399
00:23:15,560 --> 00:23:16,680
Who is it?

400
00:23:19,320 --> 00:23:19,840
Hello.

401
00:23:20,560 --> 00:23:22,890
You have three seconds
to get out of my way.

402
00:23:23,080 --> 00:23:24,400
There's only one road.

403
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:26,040
I'm even in a hurry to do the training.

404
00:23:26,040 --> 00:23:27,280
If I get held up because of you,

405
00:23:27,280 --> 00:23:28,400
I'll put your ugly photos from high school

406
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,760
on the school bulletin board.

407
00:23:29,760 --> 00:23:30,320
You...

408
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:32,600
What's the rush?

409
00:23:41,560 --> 00:23:43,320
Oh, women.

410
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:44,880
Tell me.

411
00:23:45,880 --> 00:23:47,120
What's so good

412
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,200
about Zou Cheng?

413
00:23:49,760 --> 00:23:51,360
He's just average-looking.

414
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,760
Xiaotao is too superficial.

415
00:23:57,480 --> 00:23:58,200
Gu Han,

416
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,560
as my buddy,

417
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:02,280
can you tell me the truth today?

418
00:24:06,120 --> 00:24:08,600
Have you ever really liked a girl?

419
00:24:13,960 --> 00:24:14,560
Yes.

420
00:24:15,040 --> 00:24:15,920
Who?

421
00:24:16,800 --> 00:24:17,640
Xiangxiang?

422
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,580
A girl I got to know when I was a kid.

423
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,280
But I did something

424
00:24:29,280 --> 00:24:30,680
that let her down before.

425
00:24:33,800 --> 00:24:34,560
I think

426
00:24:36,600 --> 00:24:38,260
I should treat her well first,

427
00:24:39,360 --> 00:24:40,200
and then

428
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:42,260
I can apologize to her.

429
00:24:43,800 --> 00:24:44,800
What do you think?

430
00:24:58,540 --> 00:24:59,770
[Something is wrong with your computer.
It needs to be rebooted.]

431
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:02,040
Oh, no!

432
00:25:02,040 --> 00:25:02,840
What's wrong?

433
00:25:03,890 --> 00:25:05,600
Oh, no! It's all gone!

434
00:25:06,280 --> 00:25:07,720
What a crappy computer!

435
00:25:08,040 --> 00:25:09,080
It's usually fine when I watch shows,

436
00:25:09,080 --> 00:25:11,080
but it crashes when I write my paper.

437
00:25:14,600 --> 00:25:17,560
Xiangxiang, help me in this emergency.

438
00:25:17,560 --> 00:25:19,160
May I borrow your computer?

439
00:25:19,520 --> 00:25:20,400
No problem.

440
00:25:21,080 --> 00:25:21,840
Thanks.

441
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:33,200
If a guy

442
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:35,120
used to bully you a lot,

443
00:25:35,120 --> 00:25:37,000
but he's now very nice to you...

444
00:25:37,760 --> 00:25:40,280
Hugging a guy who is usually quite aloof,

445
00:25:40,280 --> 00:25:42,800
why was I blushing
and why was my heart racing?

446
00:25:42,800 --> 00:25:44,560
How does it feel to date a guy

447
00:25:44,560 --> 00:25:46,000
who's good at sports?

448
00:25:49,560 --> 00:25:52,020
It's so obvious,
but she's still denying it.

449
00:26:06,440 --> 00:26:08,300
You've ordered so many desserts.

450
00:26:08,320 --> 00:26:09,560
So you're ripping me off again?

451
00:26:09,560 --> 00:26:11,400
It's my treat this time.

452
00:26:11,760 --> 00:26:13,800
That's not necessary. I'll pay.

453
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:19,680
Why are you suddenly looking for me?

454
00:26:19,680 --> 00:26:21,610
Haven't you been very busy lately?

455
00:26:23,600 --> 00:26:25,880
I want to ask you about something.

456
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:27,930
I don't know.

457
00:26:28,200 --> 00:26:29,600
I just want to ask you

458
00:26:30,040 --> 00:26:32,600
about Gu Han's love life.

459
00:26:32,600 --> 00:26:35,000
For example,
what kind of girl does he like?

460
00:26:35,680 --> 00:26:36,640
What?

461
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:38,440
So you've even got your eyes on Gu Han?

462
00:26:38,440 --> 00:26:40,240
With the Track & Field Captain on the left
and the Basketball Captain on the right,

463
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:42,500
are you trying to summon a divine dragon?

464
00:26:48,760 --> 00:26:49,760
A couple of days ago,

465
00:26:49,760 --> 00:26:52,040
my parents just came back from abroad

466
00:26:53,120 --> 00:26:54,960
and brought me some gifts.

467
00:26:58,600 --> 00:26:59,600
Kobe's jersey?

468
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:01,800
What's wrong?

469
00:27:01,880 --> 00:27:03,280
How is it? Do you like it?

470
00:27:03,280 --> 00:27:06,080
If you like it, just say yes,
and I'll give it to you.

471
00:27:07,600 --> 00:27:08,560
Let me tell you.

472
00:27:08,600 --> 00:27:09,480
If you miss this chance,

473
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:10,940
you won't get another one.

474
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:15,880
Three.

475
00:27:17,470 --> 00:27:18,420
Two.

476
00:27:21,520 --> 00:27:22,560
One. I'm leaving.

477
00:27:23,080 --> 00:27:23,760
Wait.

478
00:27:26,960 --> 00:27:28,890
Does it really have his autograph?

479
00:27:30,440 --> 00:27:32,100
Are you going to tell me or not?

480
00:27:32,920 --> 00:27:34,050
Okay. I'll tell you.

481
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:34,840
Come on.

482
00:27:35,520 --> 00:27:36,580
Speaking of Gu Han,

483
00:27:36,920 --> 00:27:38,920
he actually treats the people

484
00:27:39,120 --> 00:27:40,640
around him just like this.

485
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:45,920
Anyway, that's all Li Sirui has said.

486
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:47,760
Who doesn't know about Gu Han's reputation

487
00:27:47,760 --> 00:27:48,960
as the God of Iceberg?

488
00:27:49,560 --> 00:27:52,040
Is Gu Han really an ascetic?

489
00:27:52,040 --> 00:27:53,000
Since he was a kid,

490
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:54,720
he has never liked any girl.

491
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:57,600
He seemed to have said something else.

492
00:27:57,600 --> 00:27:58,460
What did he say?

493
00:27:59,280 --> 00:28:01,880
He said that when he was eating
with Gu Han,

494
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:04,080
Gu Han seemed to have said

495
00:28:04,520 --> 00:28:06,120
that he had someone he liked.

496
00:28:06,840 --> 00:28:07,720
Who is it?

497
00:28:10,720 --> 00:28:12,440
Aren't you preparing for
the topic selection of your documentary,

498
00:28:12,440 --> 00:28:13,360
so you have no time to listen?

499
00:28:13,360 --> 00:28:15,000
Why do you care so much?

500
00:28:16,280 --> 00:28:18,240
I want to hear the gossip, too. Can't I?

501
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:20,300
Only you guys can gossip, but I can't?

502
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,280
Alright.

503
00:28:22,840 --> 00:28:24,400
He said it was someone

504
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:26,320
he liked when he was a kid.

505
00:28:26,990 --> 00:28:28,710
Where is this person now?

506
00:28:29,120 --> 00:28:30,780
Does Gu Han still like her now?

507
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:33,360
That's uncertain.

508
00:28:33,360 --> 00:28:34,860
Li Sirui said that he was drunk

509
00:28:34,860 --> 00:28:37,860
and only heard this one sentence
after getting sober.

510
00:28:38,650 --> 00:28:39,760
How boring.

511
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:41,520
Listening to such baseless gossip

512
00:28:41,520 --> 00:28:42,780
is just a waste of time.

513
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:44,400
Xiangxiang,

514
00:28:44,760 --> 00:28:47,080
why don't you go ask Gu Han yourself

515
00:28:47,080 --> 00:28:49,010
so that we can know the whole story?

516
00:28:51,120 --> 00:28:53,560
Do I look like I have a lot of free time?

517
00:28:55,360 --> 00:28:56,890
Alright. Let's break it up.

518
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:08,450
Xiangxiang.

519
00:29:08,920 --> 00:29:09,720
Are you alone?

520
00:29:09,920 --> 00:29:10,640
Senior.

521
00:29:14,560 --> 00:29:16,040
How is your preparation
for the topic selection

522
00:29:16,040 --> 00:29:17,170
of the documentary?

523
00:29:17,920 --> 00:29:19,520
I'm still thinking about it.

524
00:29:21,080 --> 00:29:21,800
It's okay.

525
00:29:22,240 --> 00:29:23,760
If you really don't have any ideas,

526
00:29:23,760 --> 00:29:26,960
you can start with people
or things around you

527
00:29:26,960 --> 00:29:28,560
which you're interested in.

528
00:29:28,800 --> 00:29:29,760
For example...

529
00:29:31,320 --> 00:29:32,520
The cafeteria ladies

530
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:34,520
or the security guards at school,

531
00:29:34,520 --> 00:29:35,360
or maybe

532
00:29:35,360 --> 00:29:37,280
a group you're interested in,

533
00:29:37,360 --> 00:29:38,280
or anyone.

534
00:29:38,800 --> 00:29:40,240
As long as you dig deep into it,

535
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:42,240
they could all become good stories.

536
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:55,320
Oh, by the way, Xiangxiang,

537
00:29:55,320 --> 00:29:57,040
is your major going to offer

538
00:29:57,040 --> 00:29:58,880
a Classical Chinese Literature course?

539
00:29:58,880 --> 00:29:59,480
Yes.

540
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:02,400
That teacher
went on maternity leave previously,

541
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:03,760
and now she's back to make up the lessons.

542
00:30:03,760 --> 00:30:06,320
However, it's just an elective.

543
00:30:06,520 --> 00:30:08,050
Since it offers no credits,

544
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:10,460
I guess few people will sign up for it.

545
00:30:11,760 --> 00:30:12,760
How did you know?

546
00:30:15,760 --> 00:30:16,760
A friend of mine said

547
00:30:16,760 --> 00:30:18,440
this teacher was quite capable.

548
00:30:18,440 --> 00:30:19,640
So I was thinking about

549
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:20,640
learning about it

550
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:22,170
and maybe signing up for it.

551
00:30:23,640 --> 00:30:25,280
You're in your junior year,

552
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:28,370
but you want to sign up for an elective
from our major?

553
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:30,320
Yeah.

554
00:30:31,040 --> 00:30:33,170
I was a science student in high school,

555
00:30:33,320 --> 00:30:34,560
so my foundation
in Classical Chinese Literature

556
00:30:34,560 --> 00:30:35,800
is quite weak.

557
00:30:36,320 --> 00:30:38,920
I'm worried
that when I start working in the future,

558
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:40,520
if there are similar program requirements,

559
00:30:40,520 --> 00:30:41,980
I'll be at a disadvantage.

560
00:30:44,120 --> 00:30:46,080
Senior, your standards for yourself

561
00:30:46,080 --> 00:30:47,560
are just too high.

562
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,970
I should learn from you.

563
00:30:50,040 --> 00:30:52,440
I absolutely can't have any distractions.

564
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:53,600
Maybe

565
00:30:53,920 --> 00:30:56,200
I'll have to ask you for advice
in the future.

566
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:57,260
Feel free to ask me.

567
00:30:59,040 --> 00:30:59,970
Hurry up and eat.

568
00:31:07,840 --> 00:31:09,880
What do you think the teacher
will talk about in class later?

569
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:12,240
I think it's Chapter Three.

570
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:14,480
Go ask about it. What's the big deal?

571
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:15,610
I'll go ask about it.

572
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:16,680
What's going on?

573
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:17,680
Senior has actually signed up

574
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:19,240
for such a boring elective course.

575
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:20,200
I don't know.

576
00:31:20,560 --> 00:31:22,760
But now I have the motivation
to come to class every day.

577
00:31:22,760 --> 00:31:24,090
Class is about to start.

578
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:25,360
You guys are so noisy.

579
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:33,040
What's going on?

580
00:31:33,120 --> 00:31:35,780
The basketball team's heartthrob
is here, too.

581
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:36,880
Later,

582
00:31:37,000 --> 00:31:38,660
I'll leave Fang Yu to you guys.

583
00:31:38,760 --> 00:31:40,240
I'll still team up with Gu Han.

584
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:41,120
No need.

585
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:44,170
I also think it's more suitable
to team up with Gu Han.

586
00:31:47,530 --> 00:31:48,960
A junior from the Broadcasting Department

587
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:52,360
is going to take a freshman course
in the Chinese Department.

588
00:31:52,530 --> 00:31:55,140
[Fang Yu]

589
00:31:53,040 --> 00:31:56,240
An intimate encounter
with the traditional literature.

590
00:31:57,740 --> 00:31:59,100
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

591
00:31:58,040 --> 00:32:00,470
A new course and a new start. I'm coming!

592
00:32:04,320 --> 00:32:06,320
Alright, everyone. Let's begin.

593
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:09,800
According to the tradition of this course,

594
00:32:10,390 --> 00:32:12,040
you need to pair up to finish

595
00:32:12,040 --> 00:32:14,100
the assignment for our first lesson.

596
00:32:14,370 --> 00:32:15,370
Then you need to

597
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:19,760
use the title "To a Friend"

598
00:32:20,120 --> 00:32:21,400
to write a poem

599
00:32:21,400 --> 00:32:22,930
and give it to your partner,

600
00:32:23,160 --> 00:32:25,000
which is a way to express your feelings.

601
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:25,680
Of course,

602
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:27,000
considering that

603
00:32:27,000 --> 00:32:28,640
you're still freshmen,

604
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:31,330
we won't expect professional standards.

605
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:34,280
The main goal
is to cultivate your interest.

606
00:32:34,840 --> 00:32:36,480
Please form teams with the ones nearby.

607
00:32:36,480 --> 00:32:38,080
Let me know when you're done.

608
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:45,360
Ma'am.

609
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:48,400
Go ahead.

610
00:32:49,440 --> 00:32:50,280
Excuse me.

611
00:32:50,320 --> 00:32:52,850
I'm a student
from the College of Management.

612
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:55,600
I don't know much about this class,

613
00:32:56,120 --> 00:32:58,650
but I'm interested
in classical literature.

614
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:02,200
I hope there will be a classmate

615
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:04,600
who can help me more,

616
00:33:04,760 --> 00:33:05,280
so...

617
00:33:05,280 --> 00:33:06,040
Ma'am.

618
00:33:06,560 --> 00:33:07,560
I'll guide him.

619
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:10,120
Because we are

620
00:33:11,120 --> 00:33:11,800
friends.
